# hello-wayland: emersion's smallest Wayland client (a 128x128 window
# showing a cat, drawn once into a wl_shm buffer; a left click starts an
# interactive move). The first ported Wayland program that opens a window
# on Jam OS, through libwayland and libc's Wayland socket. It never binds
# the decoration manager, so by the owner's rule it draws its own frame:
# none (a bare picture).
